     2227                                             input my-handle
     2228                                             ,input 0
     2229                                             ).
     2230   END PROCEDURE.
     2231   PROCEDURE ByGoods:
     2232   run prn-lib-open-stream  in this-procedure (
     2233                                                input my-handle
     2234                                               ,input 43
     2235                                               ,input yes
     2236                                               ,input no
     2237                                               ).
     2238   FORM HEADER
     2239   Line format "X(231)" AT 1 SKIP
     2240   "Продолжение - на следующей странице" AT 90 SKIP
     2241   with FRAME NBottomFrame width 232
     2242   PAGE-BOTTOM NO-LABELS NO-BOX .
     2243   VIEW stream PrnLibStream FRAME NBottomFrame .
